<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px">Thank you for your interest in joining October University for Modern Sciences and Arts (MSA), The Highest British Accreditation and Partnership in Egypt.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px">We are pleased to confirm that your child’s initial registration has been received. Please follow the steps below to complete the application process.</p>
