<h2 style="margin:22px 0 8px;font-size:17px;color:#2e6431;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline">2. Your child’s 10% tuition fee discount</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px">As a student registered through our registration form, your child is eligible for a 10% tuition fee discount offered directly by MSA University.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px"><strong>After completing your registration on the “Study in Egypt” platform and selecting MSA University, please take a screenshot showing your completed registration at MSA University and reply to this email with the screenshot attached. This will allow us to confirm your registration and process your 10% tuition discount.</strong></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px">For full details on admission requirements, tuition fees for international students, and required documents, please visit the MSA International Students Admission Guide:<br>👉 <a dir="ltr" href="https://msa.edu.eg/msauniversity/admission-guide/admission-for-international-students/" style="color:#2e6431;text-decoration:underline;word-break:break-all">https://msa.edu.eg/msauniversity/admission-guide/admission-for-international-students/</a></p>
